<doc id="178591" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=178591" title="Biskuit jaé">
Biskuit jaé

gingersnap, jahe sworo seru, nut jahe, utawa jahe biscuit punika global populer &lt;a href="Biskuit"&gt;biscuit&lt;/a&gt; roso karo &lt;a href="Ja%C3%A9"&gt;jahe&lt;/a&gt;. Cepet jahe dibumbui karo jahe bubuk lan macem-macem rempah-rempah liyane, umume &lt;a href="Kayu%20legi"&gt;kayu manis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="T%C3%A8t%C3%A8s"&gt;molase&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Cengk%C3%A8h"&gt;cengkeh&lt;/a&gt;. Ana resep-resep. Gaya kacang jahe rapuh minangka versi komersial pameran tradisional sing biyen digawe kanggo pameran pasar sing saiki diwakili mung dening para &lt;a href="Pameran%20jagung"&gt;penggemar Cornish&lt;/a&gt;. 
&lt;a href="Skandinavia"&gt;Kacang jahe Skandinavia&lt;/a&gt;, uga diarani roti jahe utawa "brunkage" ing basa &lt;a href="Basa%20Dh%C3%A9nemarken"&gt;Denmark&lt;/a&gt; (tegesé "biskuit coklat"), pepparkakor ing &lt;a href="Basa%20Sw%C3%A8dhen"&gt;Swedia&lt;/a&gt;, piparkakut ing basa &lt;a href="Basa%20Suomi"&gt;Finlandia&lt;/a&gt;, piparkūkas ing basa &lt;a href="Basa%20Latvia"&gt;Latvia&lt;/a&gt;, piparkoogid ing &lt;a href="Basa%20Estonia"&gt;Estonia&lt;/a&gt; lan pepperkaker ing basa &lt;a href="Basa%20Nurw%C3%A8gen"&gt;Norwegia&lt;/a&gt; (tegesé cookie mrica) digulung cukup tipis (asring ing sangisoré 3 mm kenthel), lan dipotong dadi wujud; alus lan biasane luwih tipis lan mula luwih garing (lan ing sawetara kasus, luwih roso) tinimbang umume jinis global. &lt;a href="Cengk%C3%A8h"&gt;Cengkeh&lt;/a&gt;, kayu manis lan &lt;a href="Kapulaga"&gt;kapulaga minangka&lt;/a&gt; bahan penting, lan rasa jahe sing asli ora penting. &lt;a href="Allspice"&gt;Allspice&lt;/a&gt; lan cengkeh digunakake kanggo ngolah biskuit jahe. 
