Akuarium Osaka Kaiyukan

Akuarium Osaka Kaiyukan (海遊館, Kaiyūkan, dikenal kanthi Kaiyukan) yaiku akuarium sing ana ing distrik &lt;a href="Minato-ku%2C%20Osaka"&gt;Minato&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Osaka%2C%20Osaka"&gt;Osaka&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;, cedhak &lt;a href="Teluk%20Osaka"&gt;Teluk Osaka&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika pisanan dibukak, iki minangka &lt;a href="akuarium%20umum"&gt;akuarium umum&lt;/a&gt; paling gedhe ing saindenging jagad, lan dadi anggota Japanese Association of Zoos and Aquariums (JAZA).
Akuarium iki adohe udakara limang menit lumaku saka &lt;a href="Osakako%20Station"&gt;Setasiyun Osaka&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Osaka%20Municipal%20Subway"&gt;Osaka Municipal Subway&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Ch%C5%AB%C5%8D%20Line%20%28Osaka%29"&gt;Chūō Line&lt;/a&gt;, lan ana ing jejere &lt;a href="Tempozan%20Ferris%20Wheel"&gt;Kincir ria Tempozan&lt;/a&gt;.
