Kintetsu

Kintetsu Railway Co., Ltd. (近畿日本鉄道株式会社, Kinki-nippon Tetsudō Kabushiki-gaisha), uga diarani Kintetsu (近鉄, Kintetsu), yaiku perusahaan sepur panumpang, sing ngatur infrastruktur lan ngoperasikake layanan sepur panumpang ing Jepang. Sistem sepuré paling gedhé ing Jepang, ora kalebu &lt;a href="Japan%20Railways%20Group"&gt;Japan Railways Group&lt;/a&gt;. Jaringan sepuré nyambungake &lt;a href="Osaka"&gt;Osaka&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nara%2C%20Nara"&gt;Nara&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kyoto"&gt;Kyoto&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nagoya"&gt;Nagoya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tsu%2C%20Mie"&gt;Tsu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ise%2C%20Mie"&gt;Ise&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Yoshino%2C%20Nara"&gt;Yoshino&lt;/a&gt;. Kintetsu Railway Co., Ltd. punika anak perusahaan sing diduweni dening &lt;a href="Kintetsu%20Group%20Holdings"&gt;Kintetsu Group Holdings&lt;/a&gt; Co., Ltd.
