Osaka Metro (大阪メトロ, Ōsaka Metoro) yaiku &lt;a href="rapid%20transit%20system"&gt;rapid transit system&lt;/a&gt; utama ing &lt;a href="Area%20Metropolitan%20Osaka"&gt;Area Metropolitan Osaka&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;, dilakokno dening Osaka Metro Company, Ltd. Iki nglayani kutha &lt;a href="Osaka"&gt;Osaka&lt;/a&gt; lan kotamadya ing jejere kayata &lt;a href="Higashi%C5%8Dsaka%2C%20Osaka"&gt;Higashiosaka&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kadoma%2C%20Osaka"&gt;Kadoma&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Moriguchi%2C%20Osaka"&gt;Moriguchi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sakai%2C%20Osaka"&gt;Sakai&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Suita%2C%20Osaka"&gt;Suita&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Yao%2C%20Osaka"&gt;Yao&lt;/a&gt;. Osaka Metro dadi &lt;a href="Transportasi%20ing%20Greater%20Osaka"&gt;bagéan integra&lt;/a&gt; saka mass transit system ekstensif ing Greater Osaka (bagéyan saka wilayah &lt;a href="Kansai"&gt;Kansai&lt;/a&gt;), sing duwé &lt;a href="Dhaptar%20stasiun%20Osaka%20Metro"&gt;123&lt;/a&gt; saka 1.108 stasiun sepur (2007) ing wilayah &lt;a href="Osaka-Kobe-Kyoto"&gt;Osaka-Kobe-Kyoto&lt;/a&gt;. Ing taun 2010, wilayah greater Osaka nduweni 13 yuta penumpang sepur saben dina (pirsani &lt;a href="Transportasi%20ing%20Keihanshin"&gt;Transportasi ing Keihanshin&lt;/a&gt;) sing jumlahe Osaka Municipal Subway (kaya sing saiki dikenal) cacahe 2,29 yuta.
Osaka Metro minangka siji-sijine subway sistem ing Jepang sing sacara hukum &lt;a href="transportasi%20rel%20ing%20Jepang"&gt;diklasifikasikake&lt;/a&gt; minangka jalur trem, dene kabeh subway sistem liyane ing Jepang sacara hukum diklasifikasikake minangka jalur sepur. Nanging, nduweni ciri khas sistem metro lengkap.
