<doc id="180717" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=180717" title="Keio Corporation">
Keio Corporation

Keio Corporation (京王電鉄株式会社, Keiō Dentetsu Kabushiki-gaisha) (#ALIH) yaiku perusahaan sepur swasta Jepang ing &lt;a href="Tokyo"&gt;Tokyo&lt;/a&gt;, Jepang, lan perusahaan pusat Keio Group (京王グループ, Keiō Gurūpu) sing terlibat ing &lt;a href="transportasi"&gt;transportasi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="ritel"&gt;ritel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="real%20estat"&gt;real estat&lt;/a&gt; lan industri liyane.
Jeneng "Keio" (京王, "Keio") asalé saka njupuk siji karakter saben panggonan kang diliwati: "Tōkyō" (東京, "Tōkyō") lan "Hachiōji" (八王子, "Hachiōji"). Jaringan sepur Keio nyambungake pinggiran kulon Tokyo (&lt;a href="Ch%C5%8Dfu%2C%20Tokyo"&gt;Chōfu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Fuch%C5%AB%2C%20Tokyo"&gt;Fuchū&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hachi%C5%8Dji%2C%20Tokyo"&gt;Hachiōji&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hino%2C%20Tokyo"&gt;Hino&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Inagi"&gt;Inagi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tama%2C%20Tokyo"&gt;Tama&lt;/a&gt;) lan &lt;a href="Sagamihara"&gt;Sagamihara&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Kanagawa"&gt;Kanagawa&lt;/a&gt; karo pusat Tokyo ing &lt;a href="Stasiun%20Shinjuku"&gt;Stasiun Shinjuku&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Jalur</h2>
Jalur.
Jaringan Keio adhedhasar ing sekitar &lt;a href="Jalur%20Kei%C5%8D"&gt;Jalur Keiō&lt;/a&gt; tengah, 37,9&amp;nbsp;km, 32 stasiun.
