<li>1 Juli 1961: Beppu Kintetsu Kaikan diganti jeneng Beppu Kintetsu Department Store (別府近鉄百貨店, Beppu Kintetsu Department Store).</li>
<li>14 Maret 1972: Kintetsu Department Store Nara dibukak cedhak Stasiun Yamato-Saidaiji.</li>
