Kōbe Rapid Transit Railway

Kōbe Rapid Transit Railway Company, Limited (神戸高速鉄道株式会社 Kōbe kōsoku-tetsudō) yaiku sawijining perusahaan sepur ing pusat &lt;a href="Kobe"&gt;Kobe&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Jalur</h2>
Jalur.
Kobe Rapid Railway nduweni telung jalur.
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Jalur%20Tozai%28Kobe%29"&gt;Jalur Tozai&lt;/a&gt; (wetan-kulon)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Jalur%20Namboku%20%28Kobe%29"&gt;Jalur Namboku&lt;/a&gt; (ngalor-ngidul)</li>
</ul>
Jalur Tozai lan Namboku wis dioperasikake wiwit ngadegake perusahaan sepur nalika Jalur Hokushin minangka tambahan anyar kanggo bisnise. Perusahaan kasebut minangka Category-3 Operator (第三種鉄道事業者, dai-sanshu-tetsudō-jigyōsha) miturut Undhang-undhang Bisnis Sepur Jepang 1986 babagan kabeh telung jalur kasebut.
<h3>Jalur Tozai Line lan Jalur Namboku</h3>
Jalur Tozai Line lan Jalur Namboku.
Perusahaan ora ngoperasikaké layanan dhewe ing jalur kasebut, nanging nyedhiyakake infrastruktur sing dibutuhake kanggo papat jalur sepur swasta (&lt;a href="Jalur%20Hankyu%20Kobe"&gt;Jalur Hankyu Kobe&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Hankyu%20Railway"&gt;Hankyu&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Jalur%20Hanshin%20Main"&gt;Jalur Hanshin Main&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Hanshin%20Electric%20Railway"&gt;Hanshin&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Jalur%20Shintetsu%20Arima"&gt;Jalur Shintetsu Arima&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Kobe%20Electric%20Railway"&gt;Shintetsu&lt;/a&gt;) lan &lt;a href="Jalur%20Sanyo%20Electric%20Railway%20Main"&gt;Jalur Sanyo Electric Railway Main&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Sanyo%20Electric%20Railway"&gt;Sanyo&lt;/a&gt;) kanggo bisa ngoperasikaké sepur liwat Kobe.
Perusahaan ngoperasikaké lan ngatur stasiun ing Jalur Tozai lan Jalur Namboku (kajaba &lt;a href="Stasiun%20Sannomiya"&gt;Stasiun Sannomiya&lt;/a&gt; sing dioperasikaké déning Hankyu, &lt;a href="Stasiun%20Motomachi%20%28Hyogo%29"&gt;Stasiun Motomachi&lt;/a&gt; sing dioperasikaké déning Hanshin, &lt;a href="Stasiun%20Nishidai%20%28Hyogo%29"&gt;Stasiun Nishidai&lt;/a&gt; dioperasikaké déning Sanyo lan &lt;a href="Stasiun%20Minatogawa"&gt;Stasiun Minatogawa&lt;/a&gt; dioperasikaké déning Shintetsu) nganti September 2010, nalika operasi stasiun ing Jalur Tozai dialihake menyang Hanshin lan Hankyu, lan Stasiun Shinkaichi ing Jalur Namboku menyang Shintetsu.
<h3>Jalur Hokushin</h3>
Jalur Hokushin.
Jalur Hokushin sadurunge diduweni dening operator &lt;a href="Hokushin%20Kyuko%20Electric%20Railway"&gt;Hokushin Kyuko Electric Railway&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika Hokushin Kyuko ngalami kesulitan finansial ing taun 2002, Kobe Rapid Railway mundhut aset ril sepur saka Hokushin Kyuko.
Ora kaya stasiun Jalur Tozai lan Jalur Namboku, stasiun Jalur Hokushin ngoperasikaké lan dikelola déning Hokushin Kyuko (&lt;a href="Stasiun%20Tanigami"&gt;Stasiun Tanigami&lt;/a&gt;) lan &lt;a href="Kobe%20Municipal%20Subway"&gt;Kobe Municipal Subway&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Stasiun%20Shin-Kobe"&gt;Stasiun Shin-Kobe&lt;/a&gt;. Ing 1 Juni 2020, operasi jalur dialihake menyang &lt;a href="Kobe%20Municipal%20Subway"&gt;Kobe Municipal Subway&lt;/a&gt;.
