<doc id="180972" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=180972" title="Keisei Electric Railway">
Keisei Electric Railway

Keisei Electric Railway Company, Ltd. (京成電鉄株式会社, Keisei Dentetsu Kabushiki-gaisha) (K'SEI) yaiku perusahaan sepur swasta utama ing &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Chiba"&gt;Prefektur Chiba&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Tokyo"&gt;Tokyo&lt;/a&gt; Jepang. Jeneng Keisei yaiku kombinasi &lt;a href="kanji"&gt;kanji&lt;/a&gt; 京 saka Tokyo (東京, Tōkyō) lan 成 saka &lt;a href="Narita%2C%20Chiba"&gt;Narita&lt;/a&gt; (成田, Narita), sing nyambungake jalur utama sepur. Kombinasi iki nggunakake &lt;a href="kanji"&gt;wacan&lt;/a&gt; sing beda karo sing digunakake ing jeneng kutha.
Jalur utama sepur kasebut lumaku saka Tokyo menyang Narita lan kutha-kutha pinggiran wétan &lt;a href="Funabashi%2C%20Chiba"&gt;Funabashi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Narashino%2C%20Chiba"&gt;Narashino&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Yachiyo%2C%20Chiba"&gt;Yachiyo&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Sakura%2C%20Chiba"&gt;Sakura&lt;/a&gt;. Keisei nganggo sepur ekspres winates bandara sing diarani &lt;a href="Skyliner"&gt;Skyliner&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Stasiun%20Keisei%20Ueno"&gt;Ueno&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Nippori"&gt;Nippori&lt;/a&gt; menyang &lt;a href="Papan%20Anggegana%20Internasional%20Narita"&gt;Papan Anggegana Internasional Narita&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Jalur</h2>
Jalur.
