<doc id="180976" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=180976" title="Tobu Railway">
Tobu Railway

Tobu Railway Co., Ltd. (東武鉄道株式会社, Tōbu Tetsudō kabushiki gaisha) yaiku perusahaan sepur komuter Jepang lan &lt;a href="perusahaan%20induk"&gt;perusahaan induk&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="keiretsu"&gt;keiretsu&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Tokyo%20Raya"&gt;Tokyo Raya&lt;/a&gt; uga minangka operator antarkota lan regional ing &lt;a href="Kanto"&gt;wilayah Kanto&lt;/a&gt;. Ora kalebu perusahaan &lt;a href="Japan%20Railways%20Group"&gt;Japan Railways Group&lt;/a&gt;, sistem rel Tobu kang dawane 463.3 km iku sing paling dawa nomer loro ing Jepang sawisé &lt;a href="Kintetsu%20Railway"&gt;Kintetsu&lt;/a&gt;. Nglayani bagean gedhe saka &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Saitama"&gt;Prefektur Saitama&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Gunma"&gt;Prefektur Gunma&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Tochigi"&gt;Prefektur Tochigi&lt;/a&gt;, uga sisih lor &lt;a href="Tokyo"&gt;Tokyo&lt;/a&gt; lan sisih kulon &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Chiba"&gt;Prefektur Chiba&lt;/a&gt;.
Grup Tobu uga melu transportasi dalan (bus/taksi), real estat, lan ritel. Iku minangka pemilik &lt;a href="Tokyo%20Skytree"&gt;Tokyo Skytree&lt;/a&gt;, menara paling dhuwur ing donya. Perusahaan iki minangka anggota &lt;a href="Mizuho%20Financial%20Group"&gt;Mizuho Financial Group&lt;/a&gt;, sawijining grup finansial (&lt;a href="keiretsu"&gt;keiretsu&lt;/a&gt;) lan salah sawijining perusahaan paling gedhe ing donya.
Jeneng "Tobu" dibentuk saka &lt;a href="kanji"&gt;kanji&lt;/a&gt; kanggo wétan (東) lan &lt;a href="Provinsi%20Musashi"&gt;Musashi&lt;/a&gt; (武蔵), wilayah wiwitan sing diladèni.
<h2>Jaringan sepur</h2>
Jaringan sepur.
Tobu nduweni rong jaringan terisolasi sing disambungake dening &lt;a href="Chichibu%20Railway"&gt;Chichibu Railway&lt;/a&gt; kanggo ngangkut gerbonge.
Jaringan Jalur Utama Tobu nduweni &lt;a href="topologi"&gt;topologi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Tree%20%28teori%20grafik%29"&gt;tree&lt;/a&gt; wiwit ing &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Asakusa%20%28Tokyo%20Metro%2C%20Toei%2C%20Tobu%29"&gt;Asakusa&lt;/a&gt; Tokyo, karo &lt;a href="Tobu%20Isesaki%20Line"&gt;Jalur Isesaki&lt;/a&gt; minangka bagasi, lan &lt;a href="Tobu%20Kameido%20Line"&gt;Jalur Tobu Kameido&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tobu%20Daishi%20Line"&gt;Jalur Daishi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tobu%20Urban%20Park%20Line"&gt;Jalur Tobu Urban Park&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tobu%20Sano%20Line"&gt;Jalur Tobu Sano&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tobu%20Koizumi%20Line"&gt;Jalur Koizumi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="T%C5%8Dbu%20Kiry%C5%AB%20Line"&gt;Jalur Tobu Kiryu&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="T%C5%8Dbu%20Nikk%C5%8D%20Line"&gt;Jalur Nikkō&lt;/a&gt; mbentuk cabang, karo cabang liyane menyang &lt;a href="Tobu%20Utsunomiya%20Line"&gt;Jalur Tobu Utsunomiya&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Tobu%20Kinugawa%20Line"&gt;Jalur Tobu Kinugawa&lt;/a&gt;. Iki nawakake layanan ekspres winates sing dituku kanthi biaya tambahan saka Tokyo menyang &lt;a href="Nikk%C5%8D%2C%20Tochigi"&gt;Nikkō&lt;/a&gt; lan Kinugawa.
&lt;a href="T%C5%8Dbu%20T%C5%8Dj%C5%8D%20Line"&gt;Jalur Tojo&lt;/a&gt; lumaku lor kulon saka &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Ikebukuro"&gt;Ikebukuro&lt;/a&gt; ing Tokyo menyang tengah lan kulon &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Saitama"&gt;Prefektur Saitama&lt;/a&gt;. Sawijining cabang, &lt;a href="Tobu%20Ogose%20Line"&gt;Jalur Ogose&lt;/a&gt;, lumaku menyang &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Ogose"&gt;Ogose&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Sakado%20%28Saitama%29"&gt;Sakado&lt;/a&gt;.
Terminal Tobu ing Tokyo ana ing &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Asakusa%20%28Tokyo%20Metro%2C%20Toei%2C%20Tobu%29"&gt;Asakusa&lt;/a&gt; (Layanan ekspres Jalur Utama), &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Oshiage"&gt;Oshiage&lt;/a&gt; (bagean gedhe layanan Jalur Utama liyane) lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Ikebukuro"&gt;Ikebukuro&lt;/a&gt; (Jalur Tojo). Jalur Skytree lan Isesaki makaryakke bareng karo &lt;a href="Tokyo%20Metro%20Hibiya%20Line"&gt;Jalur Tokyo Metro Hibiya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tokyo%20Metro%20Hanzomon%20Line"&gt;Jalur Tokyo Metro Hanzomon&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Tokyu%20Den-en-toshi%20Line"&gt;Jalur Tokyu Den-en-toshi&lt;/a&gt; kanggo nglayani Tokyo tengah, kidul-kulon lan &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Kanagawa"&gt;Prefektur Kanagawa&lt;/a&gt;, sauntara Jalur Tojo makaryakke karo &lt;a href="Tokyo%20Metro%20Fukutoshin%20Line"&gt;Jalur Tokyo Metro Fukutoshin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tokyo%20Metro%20Yurakucho%20Line"&gt;Jalur Tokyo Metro Yurakucho&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tokyu%20Toyoko%20Line"&gt;Jalur Tokyu Toyoko&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Minatomirai%20Line"&gt;Jalur Minatomirai&lt;/a&gt; kanggo nglayani Tokyo tengah lan kidul-kulon lan &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Kanagawa"&gt;Prefektur Kanagawa&lt;/a&gt;.
