<doc id="181023" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=181023" title="Pol sambol">
Pol sambol

Pol sambol (Sinhala: පොල් සම්බෝල)), utawa thenkai sambal (Tamil: தேங்காய் சம்பல்), minangka &lt;a href="C%C3%A8ylon"&gt;panganan tradisional Sri Lanka sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe saka &lt;a href="Krambil"&gt;klapa&lt;/a&gt;, biasane digunakake minangka lawuh karo sega, &lt;a href="Puthu%20mayang"&gt;puthu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="apem"&gt;apem&lt;/a&gt; lan kari. Iku &lt;a href="Relish"&gt;uga&lt;/a&gt;, dumadi saka klapa, bawang, cabe garing (utawa bubuk cabe), jus jeruk, uyah lan iwak Maldives. 
