<doc id="181058" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=181058" title="Broa">
Broa

Broa ( [ˈBɾow.ɐ] utawa [ˈBɾo.ɐ]) minangka salah sawijining jinis &lt;a href="jagung"&gt;jagung&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Gandum%20ireng"&gt;roti rai kanthi&lt;/a&gt; tradisional digawe ing &lt;a href="Portegal"&gt;Portugal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Galicia%20%28Spanyol%29"&gt;Galicia&lt;/a&gt;, Angola, Mozambik, Cape Verde, lan &lt;a href="Brasil"&gt;Brasil&lt;/a&gt; (ing endi rempah-rempah biasane &lt;a href="adas"&gt;adas&lt;/a&gt;) Beda karo &lt;a href="roti%20jagung"&gt;roti jagung&lt;/a&gt; khas &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amerika Serikat&lt;/a&gt; kidul, broa digawe saka campuran &lt;a href="S%C3%A9real%20jagung"&gt;tepung jagung&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Gandum%20ireng"&gt;gandum&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Gandhum"&gt;tepung&lt;/a&gt; gandum, lan diragi nganggo ragi tinimbang &lt;a href="Bubuk%20panggang"&gt;bubuk&lt;/a&gt; manggang utawa &lt;a href="Soda%20kuw%C3%A9"&gt;soda kue&lt;/a&gt;.Jeneng " broa " asale saka tembung Gothic utawa Suebian brauth sing tegese roti.
Ing &lt;a href="Filipina"&gt;Filipina&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mam%C3%B3n"&gt;broa&lt;/a&gt; (utawa broas) sacara tradisional nuduhake &lt;a href="Driji%20wanita"&gt;ladyfingers&lt;/a&gt;, lan dudu jinis roti jagung. Kajaba iku, ing &lt;a href="Guyana"&gt;Guyana&lt;/a&gt;, broas malah minangka gaya &lt;a href="Kukis%20gula"&gt;cookie gula&lt;/a&gt; (utawa biskuit), dibumbui nganggo jeruk nipis, kayu manis, lan pala. 
